{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmeNMPVvK4TtQ869TzL4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm going with a קרן כספית יומית for the money I might need soon. Fairly sure. What decided it was the big \"3.25%\" on the comparison bars, next to \"0%\" for my עו\"ש and \"1.8%\" for a פיקדון לשנה. It was also marked \"המוצג בעמוד\" (the one this page is about), and it says I can pull money out on any trading day, with no lock-in.\n\nWhat I still don't know is what it costs. The \"כמה זה עולה\" table doesn't have one actual number in it. It just keeps saying \"אין תקרה בחוק\" (no legal cap). So I'd want to see the fee in shekels before I buy. To buy it I'd go to my bank's app or \"חשבון ניירות ערך\" (securities account) and enter the fund's number. I didn't find which fund or which number.\n\n**Where I looked, in order:**\n1. **Top of the page.** Heading \"קרן כספית\" and the subtitle: low risk, \"לא יחזיר\" (no guarantee). I read the first lines of \"מה זה\". You buy through the bank and get the money \"ביום המסחר הבא\" (next trading day).\n2. **\"למה משתמשים בזה\".** \"כסף שצריך להישאר זמין: קרן חירום\" (money that has to stay available, like an emergency fund). That's exactly my question. There was something about tax, 15% vs 25%, which I didn't really follow.\n3. **Comparison bars.** 0% / 3.25% / 3.25% / 1.8%. This is where it clicked.\n4. **\"שווה לדעת\".** A line saying \"התשואה הצפויה... לא מובטחת\" (the expected return isn't guaranteed). I scrolled past \"מי מציע ומי מפקח\". From \"כסף נכנס ויוצא\" I only took \"בכל יום מסחר\".\n5. **\"כמה זה עולה\".** A table full of fee names (דמי ניהול, עמלת קנייה, הוספה…) with no amounts. Annoying.\n6. **\"מיסוי\" and \"סיכונים ומה לא מוגן\".** I only caught \"אין ערבות של המדינה\" (no state guarantee) and \"אין ביטוח\" (no insurance). That's a bit scary.\n7. **Glossary at the end.** This is where I got bored and stopped. I didn't open \"הצגת כל הבדיקות\" and didn't look at screens 8 and 9.\n\n**Skipped:** all the little codes (MF-11, BANK-18…), the \"הצגת החוקים והכללים\" links, \"שחקו עם המספרים שלכם\" (closed) and the tax cards.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** מק\"מ, נאמן, אג\"ח ממשלתית לא צמודה, דמי משמרת, השעה היעודה, מפיץ, הרווח הריאלי / הנומינלי, קרן נאמנות פטורה / חייבת, תשקיף, לקיזוז, קרן כספית מתחדשת, קרן כספית מט\"ח.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The fees section has no numbers at all.\n- The text says it isn't guaranteed and isn't insured, but doesn't say how much I could actually lose.\n- The page never names a fund or a bank I'd recognise.\n- \"קרן כספית מתחדשת\" shows the same 3.25% and I didn't understand how it's different."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3691,"cache_read_input_tokens":13634,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3691},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd80434a-4ded-431e-a75c-6126ac0a89fc","uuid":"145efcdc-7a58-407c-89f2-00c75f45ec15","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:06:15.804Z","request_id":"req_011CgmeNMB6mUvFAiThDo7iF"}
